{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/2273","id":5320752444,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTIDrTc8AAAABPSQ9PA","html_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pull/2273","diff_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pull/2273.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pull/2273.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/issues/2273","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/2273/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/2273/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/issues/2273/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/statuses/ec4955f3f93d64d9254bba90a9185644cd9a86b5","number":2273,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Sync compile: app-server, telegram, exec, exec-server-cli and test API fixes above core","user":{"login":"IridiumMaster","id":4607679,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDc2Nzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4607679?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster","html_url":"https://github.com/IridiumMaster","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IridiumMaster/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Compile pass (#1532, PF-85-S02/S04): makes the crates above core that failed `cargo check --workspace --tests --exclude codex-core --exclude codex-tui` compile, with no conflict markers involved. Excluding a package does not stop it being built as a dependency, so app-server's lib errors were blocking tui, cli, exec and telegram too.\n\n**Behaviour-relevant ports (please read)**\n- **app-server, main's #2177 confirmed `thread/settings/update`**: upstream removed `Submission`/`CodexThread::submit_with_id`. The request now sends `Op::ThreadSettings { reply: Some(..) }` through `submit_with_trace`, and Core's accept/reject reply is forwarded to the pending confirmation (`settings_confirmation::forward_core_settings_result`). The confirmation keeps its connection removal, listener-generation and 10 s deadline handling; a lost reply stays `Uncertain`. Difference: the confirmation now follows Core's reply, which Core sends just before it emits `ThreadSettingsApplied`, instead of waiting for that notification to pass the listener.\n- **app-server**: main's `thread/spawnAgent` takes upstream's `ClientMcpExtensions` (the removed `supports_openai_form_elicitation` flag); main's `CODEX_TUI_CLIENT_NAME` restored (eager TUI materialization); workspace switching passes `allow_forced_api_for_provider_login = false`; `load_permission_config_for_thread` is test-only now.\n- **telegram**: uses upstream's embedded network policy like `exec` (load, activate on the config, bind the environment manager's HTTP client factory, hand it to the in-process client); `ExecServerRuntimeOptions`; fallible `AuthManager`; `required_human_approval: false` (approvals are chat replies, as before). Timed `ThreadItem` payloads; upstream's 16 new notifications ignored like the other non-chat ones.\n- **exec-server-cli**: main's branding carried into the crate upstream moved the command to; the missing `codex-log-guard` dependency added.\n- **external-agent-migration**: `SourceOrigin` is metadata, ignored in source/history model items.\n- **Tests**: main's tests built with upstream's fields and item shapes; assertions unchanged. app-server tests use a new `app_test_support::load_default_config_for_test` (temporary home as the session folder; main removed the cwd-less core helper in #1120). Main's #2177/#2000 tests drive `exec_command` because upstream removed the `shell_command` tool. `namespace_tools` left the wire response upstream (#50447); Core still keeps it.\n- clippy (Rust 1.99.1): skills `read_error` by value; unneeded `params: _` pattern.\n\nLedger: compile-pass rows added. Evidence: PR comments. `Cargo.lock` is security-owned (two dependency additions), so corbanu-security approval is needed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-15T07:58:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:31:10Z","closed_at":"2026-11-15T11:31:10Z","merged_at":"2026-11-15T11:31:10Z","merge_commit_sha":"55150d3a222adb9f3a47b537eddcad0e378cdcce","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CorbanuCore:sync-compile3/crates-api","ref":"sync-compile3/crates-api","repo":{"id":1283517261,"node_id":"R_kgDOTIDrTQ","name":"CorbanuTerminal","full_name":"CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal","owner":{"login":"CorbanuCore","id":315989408,"node_id":"O_kgDOEtWdoA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315989408?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore","html_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/subscriptions","organizations